WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:02.360
I found it! Over there!

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:03.620
Hoi! Joso!

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.330
Ketsu!

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.800
What were you thinking?!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.010
You'll need extra lives if
you keep fighting like that...

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.930
Yoshi, you got to stay quick
during a challenge!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.480
Hey, Tokine, are you okay?

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.180
High school student Yukimura Tokine and
junior high student Sumimura Yoshimori

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.380
are ordinary students by day.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.620
But at night, their mission is
to protect the Karasumori Site,

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.350
where the school now stands.
From the Ayakashi.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.890
I will become stronger!

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.930
I never want to see her hurt again!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:59.920
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.790
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:07.000
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.900
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.330
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.740
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.280
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.610
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:29.280
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.780
Sha la la la la...

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:40.200
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.160
(Secret romance)

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:47.370
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.130
(A strange distance)

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:55.980
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.050
Yeah

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.520
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:04.120
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:09.460
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:27.100
"'Swallow. Swallow. Little swallow.'
Said the Prince."

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:31.410
"Far away across the city,
I see a young man in a gallop."

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.750
These points will be the most important.

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.720
You should assume
that they will be on the next test.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.860
Oh. Mino Sensei...

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.490
Hm?

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.720
I have some questions I want to ask.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.670
Oh? What is it? I hope I can answer.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.170
It's this part.

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:02.340
I don't know how to translate
this English text...

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:08.140
Why don't you come
visit me during lunch?

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:11.480
I'll explain it so you can understand.
Would that be all right?

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.690
Y-Yes! I will definitely come visit!

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.560
Now if you'll excuse me.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.250
I just don't get your taste, Yuri.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.850
What do you like about him?

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.620
I-It's not like that, Kyoko-chan!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.690
I-It's not that I like him or anything.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.310
He just... intrigues me...

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.690
Oh no! What am I saying?!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.120
So what part of him intrigues you?

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.590
Um. Well... that would be...

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.730
I guess I shouldn't say anything
about the spiritual stuff...

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:00.940
Would you please keep it a secret?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.430
I promised him that I'd keep it a secret.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.170
I have to explain it without
giving that away!

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:12.110
YURI'S BRAIN

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.680
Sorry... I don't know...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.820
I just don't get it.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.660
Besides, all he ever does is sleep.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.890
There's nothing about him
that really stands out.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:30.830
It's not like he's smart.
And he's not that good at sports either.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.200
He's not very good-looking,
and to top it all off, he's short too.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.400
H-He's taller than me!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.010
Oh right.
So you like the really normal ones?

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:40.870
Huh?

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.280
Yuri! You have to go for it!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.270
W-Wait a second, Ayano-chan...

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:46.980
You have to start up a conversation!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.850
If you can find common interests,
then you've hit the jackpot!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.020
Common interests?

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.780
We do have a common interest...

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:00.790
What? Already?
Then you begin your talks from there!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.960
But it's not a very fun topic
to talk about...

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.430
Oh, what are you saying?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.630
I really shouldn't have talked about this...

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.100
Huh?

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.120
Hey, isn't that?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.380
Sumimura-kun's older sister?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.850
I didn't know she was
in the high school here...

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:30.790
But what is she doing there?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.830
W-What was with that person?!

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:38.990
What was that?

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.540
It was only for an instant
but I felt some powerful Negative Energy!

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.310
This human's no good either.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.910
I can't seem to find one
that's compatible.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.490
That was definitely
a ghost wasn't it?

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:05.660
I think I'm seeing more
of these than before.

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:10.390
I guess I should talk
to him about it.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.500
E-Excuse me!

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.000
Huh?

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.070
Oh, it's you, Kanda. What's up?

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:23.140
Why that serious look on your face?

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:28.110
Th-There's something
I want to talk to you about.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.810
Look at Yuri!
She's talking to Sumimura-kun already!

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:36.420
Is this about...
spirits and stuff like that?

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.180
Yes!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:42.060
Yuri is a lot braver than she looks.
Was she always like this?

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:44.430
Kind of like a mouse backed into
a corner will bite a cat?

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.720
More like if she's going down,
she's gonna take him with her?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.070
S-So you're saying she'll die
in battle?

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:53.240
So what happened?
Did you see something?

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.710
Yeah... about that...

00:06:57.610 --> 00:07:00.910
Is there a way to stop seeing ghosts
and things like that?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.050
I don't know.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.090
What do you mean you don't know?!

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.080
Wait. Do you have a problem
with being able to see them?

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:08.380
I do!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:10.650
Yuri is pretty good.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.490
I didn't think she would ask him
up to the roof to talk!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:13.930
I wonder if she's okay.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.560
But I'm scared of them...

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:19.720
Just ignore them,
and they'll leave you alone.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.890
I don't know how to ignore them!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.770
Don't get more scared
than you need to...

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:26.670
No. I mean...

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:31.380
I... I can't tell that they're ghosts
just by looking at them.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.540
Huh?

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.020
So what are you saying?

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:37.140
You can't tell the difference
between humans and spirits?

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.340
No!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.380
That is a pretty big problem...

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.150
I can't hear what they're saying.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:46.520
Looks like Yuri asked him out and
he doesn't know how to respond.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:48.600
You're kidding!
She already did that?

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:52.960
Just earlier. I saw a weird man
from the stairs...

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:57.330
A weird man? You're saying
he was different from a normal person?

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:01.900
Yeah, something black came
out of his body.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:03.980
Speaking of which,

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:07.040
I didn't know your older sister
was a student at our school.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.540
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.920
Um. Well I...

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.380
I saw your older sister earlier.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.250
She was with that weird man...

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:18.950
Oh!

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.320
- Tokine?!
- Sumimura-kun!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:22.930
He's coming this way!

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.370
What happened to him?

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.490
He ran away...

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.640
It can't be!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.510
It can't be!

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:43.080
No! H-Help me... Yoshimori!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:47.110
Tokine!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:50.090
Huh? W-What the...?

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.790
Wh-Who're you? What are you trying
to do with that hand?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.450
No, I... What are you doing here?

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:59.530
Can't you tell what I'm doing?!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.830
Wait, what was I doing?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.770
That's odd. Why would I
be here in the first place?

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.200
Or rather. Where am I?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.470
Hey is this girl okay?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.310
Oh no. My uniform is ruined.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.820
I'll have to ask Father to
buy me another set.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.120
I don't feel the presence
of any Ayakashi...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.860
Excuse me. Have you seen
a suspicious man around here?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.830
You mean you?

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:34.560
He's back!

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.400
Did he make up his mind?

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.070
H-How was it?

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:46.540
It's all right.
No need to worry about it.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.580
I'll take care of the bad ones.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.520
Is that enough for you?

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.950
Yeah. Thanks. Sumimura-kun.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.250
I feel much better thanks to you.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.360
Looks like it went all right!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:04.200
Really? I can't tell,
there's too much going on.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:09.830
Between the man that Kanda saw
and the one I felt

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.300
there might be someone
out of place here.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.810
I don't think Ayakashi
are active during the day...

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:19.840
but I should still tell her about it.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:31.920
No wait...
Am I acting like a stalker right now?

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:35.520
If I go out of my way to do this
and she calls me creepy again...

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.690
I'll never recover.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.600
What's with that junior high schooler?

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.370
He looks suspicious.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.730
Oh really?!

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:45.560
Huh?

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.410
Well. It's because he is
a master of English literature,

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.680
on the same level as Shakespeare.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.710
I think it will be completely worth
your while to read his works.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:57.750
Then I should read it in
its original language.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.050
Hey who's that?

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:03.850
If you'd like, come to
the English department office.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.250
I'll lend you my copies.

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.100
Why that-! He asked her out
like it was nothing!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.960
I won't let him get away with this!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.530
Go on! Trip over it!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:15.770
What?

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:21.970
What's wrong?

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:23.640
Nothing...

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.210
Who is he? He erased the Kekkai!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.920
And that cold stare...
It's like he has no emotions!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.180
Hey, Databank!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.250
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.830
Do you know that strange male teacher?!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.560
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:45.430
Uhh, it's a snobbish-looking male
teacher at the high school.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.090
Oh, and he looks a little creepy!

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:51.060
You're getting too personal.

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:55.070
Don't you know that I keep
an objective view on all my data?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:59.080
Didn't you say the other day
that rumors are also a form of data?

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.340
That's ancient history,
I've forgotten it.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:04.240
Huh?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.610
Hey, Sensei. Can you
come with us for a little bit?

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:10.820
Sure.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:12.860
Now that you mention it,

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.300
there's an English teacher
on maternity leave,

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:16.790
and someone came in to replace her.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.230
That's him! What's his name?

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.800
Mino Tatsumi.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:25.930
So you're the teacher that's
been hitting on my girl.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.230
Which one are you talking about?
I'm sure I hit on a bunch.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.440
Sorry, I don't remember
who you're talking about.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:33.450
What?!

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:34.910
That's because...

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.380
...every single one of them
follows me when I talk to them.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.650
W-Why you-!

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.160
What was that?!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.440
It's this feeling again...
The same one from earlier!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.340
I thought it was just
a compatibility issue,

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.900
but after all these experiments,
it still doesn't work.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.470
I guess it's impossible to
use humans as a food source.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.940
Looks like I'm at the end of the line.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.790
I have no choice
but to wait until nightfall...

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:28.390
Did you hear about the mass-fainting
incident over at the high school?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.730
What's that?

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:33.300
Oh, come on. Tabata was just
making a fuss over it earlier.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:36.700
Six male students all
passed out together!

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:37.780
Oh...

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.280
They're not hurt or anything,

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:43.380
but none of them remembers anything
right before they passed out!

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:48.050
This has to be another one
of the 77 wonders of this school!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.730
Oh I wonder if this has to do
with the things

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:53.160
that Sumimura-kun and I can see.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.390
But I don't need to worry
about it anymore!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.400
Oh. Come on.
You look like you're so happy.

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:03.230
Do you think we don't know?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:04.260
Huh?

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.030
I'm really impressed, Yuri!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.000
About what?

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:11.100
Oh, don't play dumb with me!
I saw you ask him out on the roof!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.010
Who asked who out?

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.300
- That's not what you were doing?!
- That's not what you were doing?!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:21.480
This is a bit of a problem...

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:26.990
Should I or should I not tell her?
But that feeling...

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.760
That Mino is definitely dangerous.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.530
I should tell Tokine
no matter what she thinks of me.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:39.340
What should I do?

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:42.240
I know. I should think of
a good way to say it.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:46.800
Yeah be delicate so that
she'll be charmed by my words...

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:50.750
Tokine we need to talk.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:54.420
I don't have time to talk to you!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:59.650
No, that's no good.
I have to be more direct.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.620
He's dangerous! Don't go near him!

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:08.070
What's wrong with that?
I love dangerous men!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:11.270
Dangerous men dangerous men
dangerous men...

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:16.780
I'm getting depressed by
my own fantasies...

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.390
An anomaly?! No this is strange.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:30.550
It's not an intruder!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:35.550
This feeling is from something
appearing within the school...

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:37.990
The same kind as that
one during the day!

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:48.370
Tokine! There's something strange
about this one!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.410
I know!

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:50.910
This is...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:56.350
Tokine... hey... this might be
a bad time to say it, but...

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:57.410
What?!

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.520
Just do it!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.220
Hey, about that teacher Mino...

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:04.850
Did you notice too?

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:05.450
Huh?

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:08.290
I've had my eye on him for
a long time.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.720
You've had your eye on him?!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.040
What's wrong with that?
I love dangerous men!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.900
Dangerous men dangerous men
dangerous men...

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:23.670
Students are getting hurt.
I should have done something sooner!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.110
Uh... uhh...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:28.750
Sensei!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:29.810
Tokine!

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:53.670
Oh, it's an honor to have you
come to us instead... Mino Sensei.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.040
Who is he?!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:02.050
Just as I thought.
You're no ordinary human.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:03.110
Huh?

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:06.380
Oh that's what she meant when
she said she had her eye on him?

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.320
You're the one that attacked
the students during the day.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.750
Why did you do it?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.760
Oh, I thought I could use them as food.

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.390
But it seems that I can't eat humans.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:19.970
But... you two may be a bit different...

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:22.530
What is he talking about?

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:24.840
Maybe he wants to feed on us?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.700
Huh?!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:30.130
Well, either way, it was certainly
worth waiting until nightfall.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:32.910
I now have all this prey in front of me.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.920
That's an interesting technique.

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:42.580
But if I were to possess someone,
it would be Ayakashi.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.050
I can't expect humans to evolve much.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:45.850
What?!

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:49.390
Ketsu!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.230
He went after Madarao?!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:53.460
What's going on?!

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:55.760
Oh?

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.370
Take this! Ketsu!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:11.310
The snake interfered with
the formation of the Kekkai!

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.050
You want to be my food that much?

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.320
It's coming from behind?!

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:17.850
Ketsu!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.830
It's faster than I thought... and long.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.230
I don't think I can surround it in one try.

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:23.990
Maybe I can surround it partially...

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:25.420
How's that?!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:28.730
You little brat!

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:31.360
The human took damage instead?!

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.900
What's going on?
Are you connected to the snakes?

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.140
That makes it more worthwhile
to beat them down!

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:48.320
What? It recovered?!

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.290
Did it get bigger too?

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.120
Hakubi, aren't those snakes Ayakashi?

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:56.960
No. They have the same scent
as that human.

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:01.740
Then that means those snakes
appeared using that person's powers.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:03.700
In other words...

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.130
He's Specially-Talented!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:07.070
But something is odd.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.670
I can also pick up a separate scent
of an Ayakashi.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.410
Now I understand!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.380
Hakubi. Where's the source of that scent?!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:17.310
Over there!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:27.590
There it is!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:31.490
Yoshimori! Can you stop the snakes
from moving for just one second?

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:32.600
Huh?

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.530
Can you do it or not?!

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.240
You only need to stop them
for one second?

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:01.490
I'll position it accurately in
a single moment!

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:05.090
Ketsu!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:07.930
I stopped them!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:09.570
Ketsu!

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:13.300
Metsu!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:27.650
Oh... oh... What have I done?

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.920
How could I hurt my own students?!

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:34.760
No, it was the Ayakashi.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:36.420
It's not your fault, Sensei.

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:40.330
So that little bug was controlling him?

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:45.110
Probably. Normally, that parasite
can only live on other Ayakashi,

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.500
but this man is Specially-Talented.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.840
So he was possessed
through his snakes...

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:56.150
Yup. They almost got me too.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.150
Ah, being beautiful is such a crime!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.250
So what are those snakes anyway?

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:01.750
I don't know.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:05.650
Powers vary among
the Specially-Talented.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.460
I know nothing about them.

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:10.490
Powers of the Specially-Talented, huh?

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.730
I guess there are many types.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.990
I know one that freaks out just
because she's able to see ghosts.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.710
All right. As long as I keep this talisman
as a charm, it can ward off evil spirits.

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:34.750
Even if anything happens,
Sumimura-kun will help me,

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:36.110
so I guess I'll be okay now!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:40.720
But is he still a dangerous person
that can control those snakes?

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:44.000
So what should I do now?

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:47.760
If possible, can you please
keep us a secret?

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.630
No, I should be the one asking that.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:53.740
I'll never let them
do anything bad ever again.

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:56.470
Please don't punish
the precious little ones!

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:58.040
Mino Sensei...

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:01.350
Well he seems like a good person...

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:04.880
and that thing with Tokine was
all just a misunderstanding.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:06.780
I guess everything is okay now.

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:08.750
Anyway, thank you.

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:11.250
You were the one that saved me.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.430
If not for you, I don't know what
would have happened to me.

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:16.060
U-Um...

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:17.200
Please... please...

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:19.430
Watch over me from now on too...

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.090
Hey you!

00:22:21.970 --> 00:22:24.310
Starting today,
you are my very own goddess!

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:25.270
What?!

00:22:25.270 --> 00:22:26.510
- What're you talking about...
- What're you talking about...

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:27.910
- you perverted teacher?!
- You perverted teacher?!

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:32.850
I'll destroy you! I'll destroy you!
Bring it on!

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:47.400
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:54.100
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:55.670 --> 00:23:03.480
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:09.810
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:19.660
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:26.020
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:35.110
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:42.640
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:44.390 --> 00:23:51.630
Even if we are near or far

00:23:51.630 --> 00:24:00.190
The red string connects one to another
